; ⛔ A BAKED shape, not `create_trimesh_shape()` at load. The web build is
; single-threaded, so building 13,122 faces of collision in `_ready` blocks
; the only thread there is and freezes the tab.
[node name="Collision" type="StaticBody3D" parent="."]

